</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act, 2003\n\nwhich runs as under:\n \n        (b) &quot;<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b>", "docsize": 12079, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Jharkhand High Court", "author": "P Kumar", "authorEncoded": "prashant-kumar", "citation": "2015 (1) AJR 404"}, {"tid": 169887329, "catids": null, "doctype": 1025, "publishdate": "2013-10-21", "authorid": 1729, "bench": [1729], "title": "Ajmer Vidyut Vitran Nigam Ltd And Others vs Gopal Ram on 21 October, 2013", "numcites": 4, "numcitedby": 1, "headline": "interpretation of  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  Explanation (b)(iv) of the Act of 2003 to include all manner of <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> / abstraction of <b>electricity</b> other than ... <b>unauthorised</b> abstraction of <b>electrical</b> energy with reference to  <b>Sections</b> <b>126</b> ,  127  of the Act of 2003 apply as much to theft of <b>electrical</b> energy", "docsize": 9073, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Rajasthan High Court - Jaipur", "author": "A Sharma", "authorEncoded": "a-sharma"}, {"tid": 8598346, "catids": [175], "doctype": 1013, "publishdate": "2012-01-25", "authorid": 1425, "bench": [1425], "title": "Tissan.J.Thachankary vs Kerala State <b>Electricity</b> Board on 25 January, 2012", "numcites": 2, "numcitedby": 1, "headline": "learned standing\n\n   counsel Sri.P.Santhalingam for the Kerala State <b>Electricity</b> Board.\n\n  2. The issue involved in this case is squarely covered by the decision ... <b>electricity</b> in excess of the\n               sanctioned/connected load shall be an &#x27;<b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b>&#x27;\n               of <b>electricity</b> in terms of <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>", "docsize": 9554, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Kerala High Court", "author": "B P Ray", "authorEncoded": "b-p-ray"}, {"tid": 195663371, "catids": [175], "doctype": 1013, "publishdate": "2011-09-29", "authorid": 1425, "bench": [1425], "title": "E.M.Jose vs The Deputy Chief Engineer on 29 September, 2011", "numcites